# TRANSLATORS: description of product "openSUSE Leap Micro 6.2"
#: leap_micro_62.yaml:9
msgid ""
"Leap Micro is an ultra-reliable, lightweight operating system built for "
"containerized and virtualized workloads."
msgstr ""
"Leap Micro ແມ່ນລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້ສູງ ແລະ ມີນ້ຳໜັກເບົາ ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນມາເພື່ອ ວຽກງານແບບ "
"container ແລະ virtualization."

