# TRANSLATORS: description of product "Leap 16.1"
#: leap_161.yaml:8
msgid ""
"The latest version of a community distribution based on the latest SUSE "
"Linux Enterprise Server."
msgstr ""
"ລຸ້ນຫຼ້າສຸດຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການພັດທະນາໂດຍຊຸມຊົນ ທີ່ອີງໃສ່ SUSE Linux Enterprise Server ລຸ້ນຫຼ້າສຸດ."

# TRANSLATORS: description of product "SUSE Linux Enterprise Server for SAP applications 16.1 Beta"
#: sles_sap_161.yaml:12
msgid ""
"The leading OS for a secure and reliable SAP platform. Endorsed for SAP "
"deployments, SUSE Linux Enterprise Server for SAP applications futureproofs "
"the SAP project, offers uninterrupted business, and minimizes operational "
"risks and costs."
msgstr ""
"ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການຊັ້ນນຳສຳລັບແພລັດຟອມ SAP ທີ່ປອດໄພ ແລະ ເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້. ໄດ້ຮັບການຮັບຮອງ ສຳລັບການນຳໃຊ້ "
"SAP, SUSE Linux Enterprise Server ສຳລັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ SAP ຊ່ວຍຮອງຮັບ ອະນາຄົດຂອງໂຄງການ "
"SAP, ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທຸລະກິດດຳເນີນໄປໄດ້ຢ່າງບໍ່ຂາດສາຍ, ແລະ ຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຄວາມສ່ຽງ ລວມທັງຕົ້ນທຶນໃນການດຳເນີນງານ."
